  "body": "The current `createSyncAccessHandle()` method is asynchronous. Since we don’t universally have [JSPI](https://v8.dev/blog/jspi) on all platforms/browsers yet, obtaining a `FileSystemSyncAccessHandle` can be unergonomic from a Wasm context. We hear developer demand for a synchronous version of `createSyncAccessHandle()` (obviously tied to Worker contexts). Is this feasible?",
